                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Where is the code change to add to users.hpp?  You're now not filling in the enumeration.  Is that because users.hpp only handles internal users and you're setting that as the default enum value?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vijaysankar Ravi",
                        "email": "vijaysankarr@ami.com",
                        "username": "Vijaysankarr"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes, that's correct. users.hpp only handles internal users and UserType defaults to Internal via the YAML default. For LDAP/AD users, there is no D-Bus object path or Attributes interface, so UserType is only populated in the GetUserInfo return dictionary in user_mgr.cpp based on the ldapConfigPath."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vijaysankar Ravi",
                        "email": "vijaysankarr@ami.com",
