                    },
                    "message": "@patrick@stwcx.xyz  @raviteja28031990@gmail.com\n\nThe corresponding bmcweb change is currently WIP pending DMTF forum feedback on the Redfish schema approach.\nCould this PDI and UM be reviewed and merged independently?"
                }
